{"title":"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>Josh has invented a jellybean doubling machine. Whenever he presses a button, the number of jellybeans inside the machine doubles. If the machine starts with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> jellybeans, how many jellybeans will be there after Josh presses the button <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because Josh pressed the button <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times, the number of jellybeans will double <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times, or will multiply by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ffbc99e2825b6f4458b370bae99157e55a79e65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{3} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, Josh will end up with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/1/a4175601627c94ad181554a6477767fbb200cf6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"14\" /> jellybeans.\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">player 1</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/2/ac2098abcfb311d8b8b9384091177474b9a386f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>This means that there will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/0/e201a35d0b1b75771858d49d95ee7440f977feda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8N = 8 \\times 4 = \\boxed{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"146\" height=\"25\" /> jellybeans at the end.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC\">2022 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Relay A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Relay A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"n